・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(27年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"71.5\" width=\"320\" height=\"5.299999999999997\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,97.2 9.1,92.2 14.2,93.8 19.3,90.0 24.5,86.1 29.6,96.6 34.7,93.1 39.8,82.4 44.9,69.0 50.0,58.9 55.1,74.8 60.3,68.6 65.4,64.6 70.5,59.4 75.6,48.1 80.7,53.3 85.8,58.2 91.0,65.6 96.1,52.5 101.2,55.7 106.3,54.3 111.4,41.6 116.5,61.7 121.6,62.9 126.8,67.8 131.9,75.4 137.0,73.5 142.1,79.7 147.2,68.6 152.3,61.0 157.4,54.2 162.6,60.4 167.7,46.4 172.8,23.3 177.9,17.9 183.0,12.8 188.1,17.5 193.2,17.7 198.4,38.9 203.5,33.4 208.6,30.2 213.7,33.0 218.8,31.6 223.9,40.1 229.0,43.0 234.2,50.9 239.3,51.2 244.4,51.2 249.5,55.3 254.6,48.8 259.7,59.6 264.9,65.4 270.0,65.4 275.1,72.6 280.2,70.5 285.3,73.8 290.4,66.2 295.5,68.1 300.7,61.3 305.8,61.9 310.9,68.1 316.0,77.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 249.5 67.3 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 280.2 82.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"77.0\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"55